From a5462c93900439ca6eb2ac0bb6de43cb2a87c94f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Dinolek <git@dinolek.me>
Date: Mon, 28 Apr 2025 01:10:04 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 010/115] clk: mediatek: Add support for non-main clocks on
 MT6785

This commit adds support for various subsystem clocks on the MT6785
platform, including AI Processing Unit, Audio, Camera, Image,
MicroController Unit, MFlexGraphics, MultiMedia, Video Decoders and
Video Encoders clocks.

These changes are required to enable proper clock management for different
hardware blocks beyond the main clock controller.

Signed-off-by: Dinolek <git@dinolek.me>
---
